s=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(27年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"69.7\" width=\"320\" height=\"13.899999999999991\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,74.6 9.1,79.9 14.2,79.2 19.3,92.7 24.5,82.1 29.6,93.7 34.7,88.9 39.8,78.0 44.9,97.2 50.0,90.1 55.1,76.3 60.3,68.4 65.4,68.7 70.5,63.6 75.6,53.0 80.7,52.6 85.8,48.3 91.0,45.0 96.1,45.3 101.2,51.0 106.3,61.5 111.4,47.9 116.5,34.1 121.6,23.3 126.8,25.2 131.9,23.4 137.0,33.5 142.1,51.1 147.2,46.5 152.3,53.4 157.4,70.2 162.6,52.3 167.7,45.9 172.8,42.8 177.9,44.4 183.0,42.9 188.1,48.6 193.2,42.1 198.4,58.8 203.5,61.3 208.6,65.5 213.7,60.9 218.8,58.2 223.9,40.0 229.0,51.7 234.2,49.6 239.3,28.3 244.4,26.0 249.5,22.8 254.6,19.5 259.7,31.4 264.9,35.4 270.0,18.0 275.1,18.0 280.2,23.5 285.3,12.8 290.4,17.7 295.5,26.7 300.7,28.1 305.8,21.1 310.9,27.9 316.0,48.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 86.6 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 106.3 73.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 157.4 82.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 208.6 77.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"48.1\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" x